{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20194",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.9,
      "end_seconds": 3.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Hello, come in. Mind the step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.87,
      "end_seconds": 7.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.93,
      "end_seconds": 14.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.66,
      "end_seconds": 19.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Well, I've been having loud snoring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.73,
      "end_seconds": 24.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.68,
      "end_seconds": 27.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "For nearly five years, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.15,
      "end_seconds": 30.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Have you noticed any triggers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.51,
      "end_seconds": 42.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.91,
      "text": "Lying on my back definitely sets it off. And I've been feeling sleepy during the day as well, for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.03,
      "end_seconds": 47.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Has there been a dry mouth in the morning too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.79,
      "end_seconds": 53.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "yes, about the same, nearly five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 53.97,
      "end_seconds": 63.52,
      "duration_seconds": 9.55,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. SpO2 98 percent on room air, temperature 36.8, heart rate 78, blood pressure 144 over 99, respiratory rate 18."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.31,
      "end_seconds": 65.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.42,
      "end_seconds": 70.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "okay, time for me to examine you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.16,
      "end_seconds": 90.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.59,
      "end_seconds": 94.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.73,
      "end_seconds": 116.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Your neck is thick and the back of the throat looks crowded."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.52,
      "end_seconds": 124.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "you can sit up now. Have you had palpitations, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.64,
      "end_seconds": 127.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "No palpitations, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.86,
      "end_seconds": 132.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "yes, carry on and what about chest pain or leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.69,
      "end_seconds": 139.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "So, no, no chest pain or leg swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.34,
      "end_seconds": 144.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Right, is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.15,
      "end_seconds": 147.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.79,
      "end_seconds": 151.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.36,
      "end_seconds": 154.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.89,
      "end_seconds": 170.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.27,
      "end_seconds": 182.86,
      "duration_seconds": 10.59,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.91,
      "end_seconds": 186.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.59,
      "end_seconds": 193.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Oh, I've had diabetes, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.0,
      "end_seconds": 205.68,
      "duration_seconds": 10.68,
      "text": "Right, so diabetes is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. So, has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.22,
      "end_seconds": 208.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "My grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.08,
      "end_seconds": 222.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.12,
      "end_seconds": 228.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Well, yes, tramadol. I get feeling very drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.04,
      "end_seconds": 232.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.49,
      "end_seconds": 243.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.28,
      "text": "I'm on sitagliptin, 100 milligrams, once a day. I do miss it now and then, to be fair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.59,
      "end_seconds": 264.55,
      "duration_seconds": 19.96,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? This looks most like symptoms that suggest obstructive sleep apnoea. I'd also keep poor sleep habits in mind. So, to recap quickly. You've had loud snoring for nearly five years, and and no leg swelling or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.26,
      "end_seconds": 268.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.61,
      "end_seconds": 282.64,
      "duration_seconds": 13.03,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a thyroid test for tiredness. Try to sleep on your side and avoid alcohol close to bedtime. We'll refer you to the sleep clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.7,
      "end_seconds": 288.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Hmm, sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.85,
      "end_seconds": 307.45,
      "duration_seconds": 17.6,
      "text": "Let's hold off on an overnight sleep study for now, and if there's no change in two weeks we can revisit it. Let's plan a check in six weeks. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.5,
      "end_seconds": 310.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "alright, thanks, take care"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.79,
      "end_seconds": 313.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}